Z||000011||California Kid||09-30-2001||01:34 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Master_Sushi:<BR><B>{{{(wire now routed to stainless ring in factory sunroof frame, invisible)}}}<P>Does this work well? Can you pick up any stations?<P>Sounds really cool if it works!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>I haven't connected my wire yet, been too lazy, and I listen mostly to custom made CD's. Members of the Michigan Fiero Club have told me they are happy with radio reception with this modification. Note: It's best to location antenna trimmer screw on radio and adjust after modification is made, pick a mid band station to adjust to.<P>||||reg||1
